### ============================================================
### langchain4j-dynamic-agent-routing — API Test Requests
###
### Works with:
###   - IntelliJ IDEA / WebStorm HTTP Client
###   - VS Code "REST Client" extension
###
### App base URL: http://localhost:8080
### (Spring Boot default port — no server.port override
### in src/main/resources/application.yaml)
###
### Seed data is loaded automatically from data.sql at startup,
### so ORD-1001 ... ORD-1006 exist out of the box.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@endpoint = {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-support
@orderEndpoint = {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-support/order
@workflowEndpoint = {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-support/workflow
@supervisorEndpoint = {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-support/supervisor

### ============================================================
### 1. General AI Chat  (JavaTechieAIAgent — no tools attached)
### ============================================================

### 1.1 Simple greeting
GET {{endpoint}}?message=Hello, who are you?

### 1.2 General knowledge question
GET {{endpoint}}?message=What is LangChain4j?

### 1.3 Coding help
GET {{endpoint}}?message=Give me a one-line summary of Spring Boot

### ============================================================
### 2. Order Support AI  (OrderSupportAIAgent — with tools:
###    getOrderStatus, cancelOrder)
### ============================================================

### 2.1 Ask for order status (triggers getOrderStatus tool)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=What is the status of my order ORD-1001?

### 2.2 Ask for delivery details (triggers getOrderStatus tool)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=When will order ORD-1001 be delivered and where is it right now?

### 2.3 Cancel an order (triggers cancelOrder tool)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=Please cancel my order ORD-1002

### 2.4 Cancel a SHIPPED order (expect error: cannot cancel shipped order)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=I want to cancel order ORD-1003

### 2.5 Order not found (expect error: Order not found)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=What is the status of order ORD-9999?

### 2.6 Non-order question (tools should NOT be invoked)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}?message=What is your return policy?

### ============================================================
### 3. Static Multi-Agent Workflow  (WorkflowSupportAgent — fixed
###    sequence: OrderAgent -> ShippingAgent -> RefundAgent ->
###    ResponseAgent, with tools getOrderStatus, trackShipment
###    and checkRefundEligibility)
###
### Watch the app console for "=== AGENT START ===" /
### "TOOL CALLED -> ..." / "=== AGENT END ===" log lines.
### ============================================================

### 3.1 Refund request (runs the full fixed pipeline)
GET {{workflowEndpoint}}?request=Can I get a refund for my order ORD-1001?

### 3.2 Shipping question through the workflow (includes tracking number)
GET {{workflowEndpoint}}?request=Where is my order ORD-1003 and what is the tracking number?

### 3.3 Compound request: shipping + refund in one question
GET {{workflowEndpoint}}?request=What is the delivery status of order ORD-1001 and can it still be refunded?

### 3.4 Refund request for an unknown order (expect graceful handling)
GET {{workflowEndpoint}}?request=Please refund my order ORD-9999

### ============================================================
### 4. Supervisor Dynamic Routing  (SupervisorAgent — an LLM
###    decides at runtime which sub-agents to invoke based on
###    the request and the @Agent descriptions)
###
### Contrast with section 3: a shipping-only question here
### should NOT invoke RefundAgent, while the fixed workflow
### always runs every agent.
### ============================================================

### 4.1 Order-status question (supervisor should route to OrderAgent,
###     and usually ResponseAgent for the final answer)
GET {{supervisorEndpoint}}?request=What is the status of my order ORD-1001?

### 4.2 Shipping-only question (supervisor should pick ShippingAgent —
###     no refund agent needed; compare with 3.2)
GET {{supervisorEndpoint}}?request=What is the tracking number and current location of my shipment for order ORD-1003?

### 4.3 Refund-only question (supervisor should pick OrderAgent +
###     RefundAgent, skipping ShippingAgent)
GET {{supervisorEndpoint}}?request=Am I eligible for a refund on order ORD-1001?

### 4.4 Compound request (supervisor must combine several agents)
GET {{supervisorEndpoint}}?request=Where is my order ORD-1004, what is the tracking number, and can I still get a refund?

### 4.5 Refund on an order with no refund policy (ORD-1006 is Packed —
###     expect curated RefundPolicyNotFoundException message)
GET {{supervisorEndpoint}}?request=Can I get a refund for my order ORD-1006?

### 4.6 Tracking for an order that has not shipped (ORD-1002 is
###     Processing — expect curated ShipmentTrackingNotFoundException message)
GET {{supervisorEndpoint}}?request=What is the tracking number for my order ORD-1002?

### 4.7 Non-order question (supervisor should answer directly / route
###     to the response agent only — no tools invoked)
GET {{supervisorEndpoint}}?request=What is your return policy?

### ============================================================
### 5. Negative / Edge Cases
### ============================================================

### 5.1 Missing required 'message' param (expect 400 Bad Request)
GET {{endpoint}}

### 5.2 Missing required 'message' param on order endpoint (expect 400)
GET {{orderEndpoint}}

### 5.3 Missing required 'request' param on workflow endpoint (expect 400)
GET {{workflowEndpoint}}

### 5.4 Missing required 'request' param on supervisor endpoint (expect 400)
GET {{supervisorEndpoint}}

### 5.5 Empty message value
GET {{endpoint}}?message=

### ============================================================
### 6. Handy cURL equivalents (copy/paste into a terminal)
### ============================================================

# General chat:
# curl "http://localhost:8080/api/ai-support?message=Hello"
#
# Order status:
# curl "http://localhost:8080/api/ai-support/order?message=What%20is%20the%20status%20of%20my%20order%20ORD-1001%3F"
#
# Static multi-agent workflow:
# curl "http://localhost:8080/api/ai-support/workflow?request=Can%20I%20get%20a%20refund%20for%20my%20order%20ORD-1001%3F"
#
# Supervisor dynamic routing:
# curl "http://localhost:8080/api/ai-support/supervisor?request=What%20is%20the%20tracking%20number%20for%20my%20order%20ORD-1003%3F"
